  "description": "Coding agent observability for Claude Code and pi. This dashboard reads metrics from Mimir, logs from Loki, and traces from Tempo. No panel groups by, displays, or filters on a user identity label, for example an email address or a user account identifier. This rule keeps the dashboard safe to share as a screenshot in a public README. Keep this rule when you add a panel.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [],
